<section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">About ATECT</div><h1>Architecture with purpose.</h1><p>A design-focused architecture studio serving residential and commercial clients throughout Maryland, Washington, DC, and Virginia.</p></section>
<section class="prose"><h2>Design that connects vision and reality.</h2><p>ATECT Architecture approaches each project as a design problem to be understood before it is documented. The goal is to create spaces that respond to the property, the client's priorities and the practical requirements of construction.</p><p>Our work can include custom homes, additions, renovations, commercial environments, construction documents and three-dimensional visualization. The scope is shaped around the needs of each project.</p><h2>A practical design process.</h2><p>Clear communication is central to the work. Early decisions establish direction; design development refines the solution; documentation communicates the final intent. Clients should understand what is being designed and why before moving into construction.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Service Area</strong><br />Maryland • Washington, DC • Virginia</div><a class="button dark" href="/contact">Discuss Your Project</a></section>
